	(text "The Pico dims the backlight with 25 kHz PWM on GP15. R702 holds CTRL low until the firmware runs,\nso the display stays dark if the Pi or the Pico hang (fail-dark, docs/adr/0006)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 20.828 0)
		(effects
